# B. Registration & Verification

## AC-B01 Pharmacy registration
- New owner registers pharmacy.
- Expected: Business Type Pharmacy created; trading blocked until verified.
- Pass: Business exists, cannot place orders yet. Fail: Can trade unverified.

## AC-B02 Stockist registration
- Same as AC-B01 for Stockist.
- Pass/Fail analogous.

## AC-B03 Submit verification docs
- Business submits required documents.
- Expected: Verification Submitted/Under Review; admin can see queue item.
- Pass: Queue entry exists. Fail: No reviewable submission.

## AC-B04 Admin approve business
- Admin approves complete application.
- Expected: Business Verified; trading capabilities enabled.
- Pass: Can create connections/orders per role. Fail: Still blocked or approved with missing docs.

## AC-B05 Admin reject business
- Admin rejects with reason.
- Expected: Business cannot trade; reason visible to business.
- Pass: Trade blocked + reason shown. Fail: Trade allowed or no reason.

## AC-B06 Duplicate GST blocked/flagged
- Second business attempts same GST against uniqueness policy.
- Expected: Block or admin flag; no silent dual verified GST.
- Pass: Policy enforced. Fail: Two verified actives same GST.

## AC-B07 Self-approval impossible
- Business user attempts to approve own verification.
- Expected: Denied.
- Pass: Remains unverified. Fail: Self-verified.

