# C. Staff & Permissions

## AC-C01 Invite staff
- Owner invites staff with role.
- Expected: User Invited; invite can be accepted.
- Pass: Invite lifecycle works. Fail: Staff active with no invite trail.

## AC-C02 Permission deny
- Pharmacy staff without payment permission tries to pay.
- Expected: Denied; no payment created.
- Pass: No Payment entity. Fail: Payment created.

## AC-C03 Remove staff preserves history
- Remove user who created orders.
- Expected: Access revoked; orders remain with attribution.
- Pass: History intact. Fail: Orders deleted or unattributed illegally.

## AC-C04 Cannot remove sole owner
- Attempt to remove only owner.
- Expected: Blocked until ownership transfer.
- Pass: Owner remains. Fail: Ownerless business.

## AC-C05 Delivery boy limited view
- Delivery boy opens financial analytics.
- Expected: Denied / not available.
- Pass: No financial dashboard access. Fail: Sees receivables/profit data.

