# D. Connections

## AC-D01 Request connection
- Verified pharmacy requests verified stockist.
- Expected: Connection Requested; stockist notified.
- Pass: Request visible to stockist. Fail: Auto-active or missing.

## AC-D02 Approve connection
- Stockist approves.
- Expected: Connection Active; pharmacy can browse catalogue/order.
- Pass: Trade enabled. Fail: Still cannot browse/order.

## AC-D03 Reject connection
- Stockist rejects with reason.
- Expected: Rejected; pharmacy cannot order; reason available.
- Pass: Order blocked. Fail: Order still possible.

## AC-D04 Order without connection
- Pharmacy attempts order to non-active partner.
- Expected: Blocked.
- Pass: No order. Fail: Order created.

## AC-D05 Disconnect preserves invoices
- Active pair with invoices disconnects.
- Expected: Connection not Active; historical invoices remain; new orders blocked.
- Pass: History + block new trade. Fail: Invoices disappear or new orders allowed.

## AC-D06 Duplicate active connection
- Second Active connection for same pair.
- Expected: Prevented.
- Pass: Only one Active. Fail: Duplicates exist.

