# E. Catalogue & Orders

## AC-E01 Browse catalogue connected
- Active connection pharmacy browses stockist catalogue.
- Expected: Sees permitted products/prices.
- Pass: Products visible. Fail: Empty despite active catalogue/connection.

## AC-E02 Place order
- Pharmacy submits valid cart.
- Expected: Order Pending; stockist notified; no inventory ownership transfer yet; no invoice yet.
- Pass: Order exists Pending. Fail: Wrong status or premature invoice/stock consumption.

## AC-E03 Empty order blocked
- Submit zero lines.
- Expected: Validation error; no order.
- Pass: No Pending order. Fail: Empty order exists.

## AC-E04 Accept order
- Stockist accepts Pending order.
- Expected: Order Accepted; pharmacy notified; reservation may occur per rules.
- Pass: Status Accepted. Fail: Skips to Delivered or remains Pending after accept success UI.

## AC-E05 Reject order
- Stockist rejects with reason.
- Expected: Rejected; no fulfilment; pharmacy sees reason.
- Pass: Terminal reject path. Fail: Still fulfilable.

## AC-E06 Cancel eligible order
- Pharmacy cancels while permitted.
- Expected: Cancelled; reservations released if any.
- Pass: Cancelled + no dangling reserve. Fail: Cancel ignored or stock stuck reserved.

## AC-E07 Forbidden cancel after lock
- Cancel after dispatch when forbidden.
- Expected: Denied; status unchanged.
- Pass: Remains Dispatched/etc. Fail: Illegally cancelled.

## AC-E08 Double submit order
- Same place-order action repeated rapidly.
- Expected: One order only.
- Pass: Single Order number. Fail: Duplicates.

## AC-E09 Price snapshot integrity
- Stockist changes product price after order placed.
- Expected: Existing order line price unchanged.
- Pass: Historical price stable. Fail: Old order totals rewrite.

