# F. Fulfilment & Delivery

## AC-F01 Pack order
- Stockist packs Accepted order.
- Expected: Packed status.
- Pass: Packed. Fail: Impossible jump to Delivered without delivery.

## AC-F02 Dispatch
- Stockist dispatches packed order.
- Expected: Delivery created/active; Order Dispatched.
- Pass: Tracking available. Fail: Dispatched with no delivery record when required.

## AC-F03 Full delivery
- Delivery completed fully.
- Expected: Delivery Delivered; Order Delivered; return eligibility may begin.
- Pass: Status sync correct. Fail: Order Delivered but delivery Failed or missing.

## AC-F04 Partial delivery
- Only some qty delivered.
- Expected: Partially Delivered; delivered qty recorded; remainder pending.
- Pass: Quantities accurate. Fail: All marked delivered.

## AC-F05 Failed delivery
- Mark failed with reason.
- Expected: Not Delivered; retry/return-to-stockist path available.
- Pass: No false completion. Fail: Failed counted as Delivered.

## AC-F06 Expired batch dispatch blocked
- Attempt dispatch allocated expired batch.
- Expected: Blocked.
- Pass: No delivery of expired sellable goods. Fail: Delivered expired.

## AC-F07 Negative inventory blocked
- Allocate/dispatch beyond available.
- Expected: Error; inventory unchanged illegally.
- Pass: On Hand never negative. Fail: Negative stock.

## AC-F08 Pharmacy records shortage
- Pharmacy reports received < delivered claimed.
- Expected: Shortage recorded; stockist notified; adjustment/return path available.
- Pass: Dispute trail exists. Fail: Silent ignore.

