# G. Invoicing

## AC-G01 Issue invoice from billable fulfilment
- Stockist issues invoice for billable qty.
- Expected: Invoice Issued; outstanding = grand total; pharmacy notified.
- Pass: Liability created correctly. Fail: No outstanding or wrong total.

## AC-G02 Invoice calculation correctness
- Given known lines/tax/discount.
- Expected: Matches Business Calculations exactly.
- Pass: All components match formula. Fail: Any mismatch.

## AC-G03 Double bill blocked
- Attempt second invoice for already fully billed qty.
- Expected: Blocked.
- Pass: No duplicate liability. Fail: Double billed.

## AC-G04 Invoice before dispatch default blocked
- Attempt invoice before allowed fulfilment point under default rules.
- Expected: Blocked unless bill-ahead enabled.
- Pass: Policy enforced. Fail: Premature invoice default allowed.

## AC-G05 Void paid invoice blocked
- Void after paid/partial beyond rules.
- Expected: Denied.
- Pass: Invoice remains. Fail: Paid invoice voided casually.

## AC-G06 Issued invoice immutable lines
- Edit issued line price.
- Expected: Denied.
- Pass: Lines unchanged. Fail: Quiet rewrite.

