# H. Payments & Credit

## AC-H01 Submit payment
- Pharmacy submits payment with valid allocation.
- Expected: Payment Submitted; stockist can review; outstanding unchanged until approve.
- Pass: No premature settlement. Fail: Auto-paid on submit.

## AC-H02 Approve payment
- Stockist approves.
- Expected: Payment Approved; invoice outstanding reduced; status Partially Paid/Paid derived correctly.
- Pass: Outstanding formula holds. Fail: Wrong outstanding.

## AC-H03 Reject payment
- Stockist rejects with reason.
- Expected: No settlement effect; pharmacy notified.
- Pass: Outstanding unchanged. Fail: Reduced despite reject.

## AC-H04 Allocation > outstanding blocked
- Allocate too much to an invoice.
- Expected: Validation fail.
- Pass: No approve with illegal allocation. Fail: Negative outstanding.

## AC-H05 Duplicate payment flagged/blocked
- Same reference/amount suspicious duplicate.
- Expected: Block or On Hold review.
- Pass: Not auto-approved duplicate. Fail: Silent double settle.

## AC-H06 Pharmacy cannot approve payment
- Pharmacy attempts approve.
- Expected: Denied.
- Pass: Status not Approved by pharmacy. Fail: Self-approve works.

## AC-H07 Apply credit
- Apply remaining credit to outstanding invoice.
- Expected: Outstanding and remaining credit reduced by min rule.
- Pass: Both ledgers correct. Fail: One updates without the other.

## AC-H08 Credit > outstanding apply
- Apply large credit to small outstanding.
- Expected: Apply only outstanding; leftover remains available.
- Pass: Outstanding 0; credit leftover > 0. Fail: Negative outstanding or leftover lost.

## AC-H09 Pay historical invoice after disconnect
- Disconnected pair settles old invoice.
- Expected: Allowed.
- Pass: Settlement works. Fail: Blocked solely due to disconnect.

