# J. Inventory & Batches

## AC-J01 Add batch stock
- Add batch with qty/expiry.
- Expected: On Hand increases; Available computed correctly.
- Pass: Formula holds. Fail: Wrong availability.

## AC-J02 Low stock flag
- Available ≤ reorder level.
- Expected: Low stock visible.
- Pass: Flagged. Fail: Not flagged when threshold met.

## AC-J03 Auto expire batch
- Date passes expiry.
- Expected: Batch Expired; not newly allocatable.
- Pass: Allocation blocked. Fail: Still sold.

## AC-J04 Recall blocks allocation
- Mark recalled.
- Expected: Cannot allocate/dispatch as sellable.
- Pass: Blocked. Fail: Still allocated.

## AC-J05 Adjustment requires reason
- Adjust without reason.
- Expected: Denied.
- Pass: No movement. Fail: Silent adjust.

---

# K. Notifications & Messages

## AC-K01 Order placed notification
- After order submit.
- Expected: Stockist recipients get notification; destination order detail.
- Pass: Notification exists. Fail: No notice and no alternative queue signal.

## AC-K02 Notification does not approve
- User has notification only.
- Expected: Entity state unchanged until official action.
- Pass: No transition from notification alone. Fail: Auto-transition.

## AC-K03 Message approval ignored
- Message content “Approved”.
- Expected: Order/payment unchanged.
- Pass: Official status same. Fail: Status changed by message.

## AC-K04 Notify failure doesn’t roll back invoice
- Invoice issued; notify fails.
- Expected: Invoice remains Issued.
- Pass: Liability persists. Fail: Invoice rolled back due to notify fail.

