# L. Search / Export / Dashboard

## AC-L01 Order search by number
- Search exact order number.
- Expected: Matching order visible if permitted.
- Pass: Found. Fail: Missing accessible order.

## AC-L02 Filter overdue invoices
- Apply overdue filter.
- Expected: Only overdue outstanding invoices.
- Pass: Set correct. Fail: Paid/non-overdue included wrongly.

## AC-L03 Export respects permissions
- Staff without export permission exports invoices.
- Expected: Denied.
- Pass: No export. Fail: File produced.

## AC-L04 Dashboard outstanding matches list
- Compare dashboard outstanding card vs filtered invoice outstanding sum.
- Expected: Equal per calculations.
- Pass: Match. Fail: Mismatch without stale explanation.

## AC-L05 Cross-business search isolation
- Search another business’s invoice number.
- Expected: Not available.
- Pass: No leak. Fail: Visible.

