# M. Admin Governance

## AC-M01 Suspend business
- Admin suspends verified business.
- Expected: Suspended; new trade blocked; history retained; notified.
- Pass: Trade blocked + history. Fail: Can still order or history wiped.

## AC-M02 Reactivate business
- Admin reactivates.
- Expected: Trading restored per verification/active rules.
- Pass: Can trade again. Fail: Permanently stuck.

## AC-M03 Admin cannot create trade order
- Admin attempts place order as admin tool.
- Expected: Denied.
- Pass: No admin-created trade order. Fail: Admin trades.

## AC-M04 Audit log records suspension
- After suspend.
- Expected: Audit shows actor, time, reason, target business.
- Pass: Complete audit. Fail: Missing trail.

## AC-M05 Support ticket no financial mutate
- Resolve ticket.
- Expected: Ticket resolved; invoices unchanged unless separate official action.
- Pass: No silent finance change. Fail: Totals changed by ticket close.

