# N. State Machine Audit Checks

## AC-N01 Forbidden transition Pending → Delivered
- Attempt direct jump.
- Expected: Denied.
- Pass: State unchanged illegally. Fail: Jump allowed.

## AC-N02 Rejected → Accepted forbidden
- Attempt.
- Expected: Denied.
- Pass: Remains Rejected. Fail: Reopened as Accepted illegally.

## AC-N03 Payment Approved → Draft forbidden
- Attempt.
- Expected: Denied.
- Pass: Remains Approved. Fail: Reopened draft.

## AC-N04 Credit Fully Applied → Void forbidden
- Attempt.
- Expected: Denied without controlled reversal.
- Pass: Still Fully Applied. Fail: Voided away applied credit.

