# O. Calculation Audit Checks

## AC-O01 Invoice outstanding formula
- Grand Total 1000; approved payments 400; credit applied 100.
- Expected: Outstanding 500.
- Pass: 500. Fail: Any other.

## AC-O02 Available inventory formula
- On Hand 50; Reserved 20.
- Expected: Available 30.
- Pass: 30. Fail: Other.

## AC-O03 GST split intra-state
- Net 100; GST 12% intra-state.
- Expected: CGST 6; SGST 6; IGST 0.
- Pass: Exact. Fail: Wrong split.

## AC-O04 Remaining credit formula
- Credit 200; applied 50.
- Expected: Remaining 150.
- Pass: 150. Fail: Other.

