# P. Edge Acceptance Samples

## AC-P01 Connection removed mid-pending
- Disconnect while order Pending.
- Expected: New orders blocked; pending handled by policy without orphan illegal state.
- Pass: Valid terminal/decision path. Fail: New orders still created.

## AC-P02 Concurrent allocate same stock
- Two accepts/allocates exceed stock.
- Expected: Only sufficient allocations succeed.
- Pass: Never over-allocated. Fail: Both succeed beyond stock.

## AC-P03 Network retry place order
- Uncertainty then retry.
- Expected: Idempotent single order.
- Pass: One order. Fail: Two orders.

## AC-P04 Analytics mismatch trust source
- Chart disagrees with invoice list.
- Expected: Invoice documents win; analytics refreshable/stale.
- Pass: No invoice rewrite. Fail: Invoices altered to match chart.

