# Coverage Expansion Plan

This audit specification must continue growing until every journey in Part 8 and every critical edge case in Part 15 has at least one measurable criterion.

Priority expansion order:

1. Money integrity
2. Inventory integrity
3. Permission boundaries
4. State machine forbidden transitions
5. Verification/suspension gates
6. Delivery/return safety
7. Search/export isolation
8. Dashboard reconciliation

---

# Completion Criteria for a Capability

A capability is audit-complete when it has:

- Happy-path AC
- Permission-deny AC
- Invalid-state AC
- Calculation AC (if numeric)
- Edge/concurrency AC (if create/approve/settle)

